  "description": "<p>🖊️ PERSONALIZED CLASSROOM DOORMAT: Make your classroom feel extra special by personalizing this doormat with the teacher’s name. Click “CUSTOMIZE” to enter your details and place your order!, 🎁 PERFECT BACK-TO-SCHOOL GIFT: A thoughtful and unique gift for teachers, ideal for welcoming students back to school, celebrating the first day, birthdays, Christmas, or Thanksgiving. Customizable with the teacher’s name., 🌟 HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: Soft and durable non-woven fabric top that’s heat-resistant, with a neoprene rubber non-slip backing. Effectively dries wet feet, and traps dirt, dust, and grime to keep your floors clean., 📏 IDEAL FOR CLASSROOM: Available in four sizes: 16x24 inches, 18x30 inches, 19x32 inches, and 24x36 inches. Perfect for both indoor and outdoor use, making it a versatile addition to classrooms, entryways, and RVs., 🧼 EASY TO MAINTAIN: The doormat is washable and easy to clean. Simply hose it down or sponge clean with mild liquid soap. Avoid bleaching and let it air dry for long-lasting use.</p>",
